" end="00:19.410">bitch </span><span begin="00:19.410" end="00:19.950">backwards</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.950" end="00:21.960"><span begin="00:19.950" end="00:20.110">*</span><span begin="00:20.110" end="00:20.270">*</span><span begin="00:20.270" end="00:20.430">*</span><span begin="00:20.430" end="00:20.610">* </span><span begin="00:20.610" end="00:20.670">a </span><span begin="00:20.670" end="00:21.090">princess</span><span begin="00:21.090" end="00:21.090">, </span><span begin="00:21.090" end="00:21.210">I'm </span><span begin="00:21.210" end="00:21.300">a </span><span begin="00:21.300" end="00:21.960">king</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.260" end="00:24.030"><span begin="00:22.260" end="00:22.530">Bow </span><span begin="00:22.530" end="00:22.740">down </span><span begin="00:22.740" end="00:22.830">and </span><span begin="00:22.830" end="00:23.070">kiss </span><span begin="00:23.070" end="00:23.160">on </span><span begin="00:23.160" end="00:23.310">my </span><span begin="00:23.310" end="00:24.030">ring</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.240" end="00:25.920"><span begin="00:24.240" end="00:24.720">Being </span><span begin="00:24.720" end="00:24.780">a </span><span begin="00:24.780" end="00:25.050">bitch </span><span begin="00:25.050" end="00:25.170">is </span><span begin="00:25.170" end="00:25.290">my </span><span begin="00:25.290" end="00:25.920">kink</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.950" end="00:28.130"><span begin="00:25.950" end="00:26.460">What </span><span begin="00:26.460" end="00:26.580">the </span><span begin="00:26.580" end="00:26.640">*</span><span begin="00:26.640" end="00:26.700">*</span><span begin="00:26.700" end="00:26.760">*</span><span begin="00:26.760" end="00:26.820">* </span><span begin="00:26.820" end="00:27.030">else </span><span begin="00:27.030" end="00:27.180">did </span><span begin="00:27.180" end="00:27.300">you </span><span begin="00:27.300" end="00:28.050">think</span><span begin="00:28.050" end