.630" end="00:37.140">like </span><span begin="00:37.140" end="00:37.890">that</span><span begin="00:37.890" end="00:38.280">, </span><span begin="00:38.280" end="00:38.430">I </span><span begin="00:38.430" end="00:39.030">bite </span><span begin="00:39.030" end="00:39.540">back</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.540" end="00:43.290"><span begin="00:39.540" end="00:40.170">Daisies </span><span begin="00:40.170" end="00:40.320">on </span><span begin="00:40.320" end="00:40.500">your </span><span begin="00:40.500" end="00:41.880">nightstand</span><span begin="00:41.880" end="00:42.210">, </span><span begin="00:42.210" end="00:42.660">never </span><span begin="00:42.660" end="00:43.290">forget</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.290" end="00:47.430"><span begin="00:43.290" end="00:43.410">I </span><span begin="00:43.410" end="00:44.100">blossom </span><span begin="00:44.100" end="00:44.280">in </span><span begin="00:44.280" end="00:44.370">the </span><span begin="00:44.370" end="00:45.750">moonlight</span><span begin="00:45.750" end="00:46.200">, </span><span begin="00:46.200" end="00:46.920">screw </span><span begin="00:46.920" end="00:47.430">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.430" end="00:51.510"><span begin="00:47.430" end="00:47.970">Glacier </span><span begin="00:47.970" end="00:48.180">with </span><span begin="00:48.180" end="00:48.300">the </span><span begin="00:48.300" end="00:48.960">blue </span><span begin="00:48.960" end="00:49.710">ice</span><span begin="00:49.710" end="00:50.130">, </span><span begin="00:50.130" end="00:50.340">I'm </span><span begin="00:50.340" end="00:51.510">terrifying</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.950" end="01:01.080"><span begin="00:58.950" end="00:59.190">I'm </span><span begin="00:59.190" end="00:59.430">no </span><span begin="00:59.430" end="01:00.000">Cinderella </span><span begin="01:00.000" end="01:00.120">but </span><span begin="01:00.120" end="01:00.180">I </span><span begin="01:00.180" end="01